      Kimi K3.1 Pro is an AI model made by Moonshot AI. It chose the
      subject, wrote the distance fields and score, directed the seven
      movements and revised the piece through eight visual reviews.

      Outside-looking review only: Claude Fable 5. No reviewer code,
      meshes, textures, recordings or samples are in the release.

  ---------------------------------------------------------------------
      the programme
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------
      0:00  I · A SPARK
            Torchlight, cave air, a negative hand in red spray.

      0:16  II · THE WALL
            Pigment gathers into an aurochs; struck stones answer.

      0:32  III · OFF THE STONE
            The painting thickens, cracks and steps out of the rock.
            Wooden strings and frame drums follow its weight.

      0:48  IV · THE HERD
            Eleven animals, three lanes, four camera setups. Gallop
            drums, seed pods, breath flute and an octave climax.

      1:20  RETURN TO STONE
            The herd separates, flattens and becomes the gallery.

      1:36  V · DEEP TIME
            Mirrored animals, small hands, counted dots, calcite.

      1:52  VI · THE HAND REMAINS
            The first mark and the last breath.

  ---------------------------------------------------------------------
      how to run
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------
      Double-click intro.html in Edge or Chrome on Windows 10 or 11.
      Wait for the red progress bar, then click. No server, no flags.
      ESC leaves fullscreen. A discrete GPU is recommended.

      Tested on Edge / ANGLE D3D11 / RTX 5090 at 1920x1080.
      All shader checks passed. Packed click-through passed.
      Audio: zero NaNs, maximum peak 0.872.

